{#- Inline SVG icons, in place of a 306KB icon font.

    Usage: {% set name = "download" %}{% include "icon.njk" %}

    Two maps: `icons` are drawn as strokes, `solid` are filled shapes. A name
    in neither map falls back to a generic link symbol, so a typo in
    content/site.yaml degrades to something sensible rather than a blank gap.

    These are simple line symbols in the site's own style, not official brand
    marks - which keeps the footer visually coherent. -#}

